        <mxCell id="jkLi0TPz_C_0VwSvdQQQ-65" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fillColor=#FAFAFA;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The project starts when the Lead is created. Phase 1 begins immediately and its tasks are generated from the active requirement templates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A phase advances only through an approved sign-off request. If a sign-off is rejected, the phase returns to In Progress with the decision note.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Task completion depends on the task authority. REP tasks can be completed by the responsible user, while MANAGER tasks require manager confirmation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Client contact is based on recorded client-facing activity. Internal activity is tracked separately and does not make the lead Hot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The cold-lead threshold is configurable in System Settings." vertex="1">
